ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 12464, Jun. 17, 1988>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 Omitted.
Article 3 (Incorporation Expenses)
Expenses incurred in incorporating the Corporation shall be borne by the Industrial Sites Development Corporation.
Article 4 (Transitional Measures)
